Z||000015||Fiero2||08-19-2001||10:31 PM||||I love my 88. I love it so much in fact, I changed my plates from "FIERO2" to "LVMY88". Couldn't do "LUVMY88" yet as NH has only approved 7 numbers on the plate, not 7 letters yet.<P>So far I have converted it from a notchback to a fastback, added hood vents, side sail GT scoops, lower quarter Mecham scoops, Formula leather steering wheel, "Fiero Formula" spare tire cover, custom dual exhaust set-up for a much louder growl, GT seats and bigger tread all around just to name a few things.<P>Marian Kelley<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Marians_sig_1.jpg">  <BR>I LOVE my Fiero!!!||||reg||6
